     * Starts a Sandbox and waits for it to be ready.
     *
     * @param {Sandbox} sandbox - The Sandbox to start
     * @param {number} [timeout] - Optional timeout in seconds (0 means no timeout)
     * @returns {Promise<void>}
     *
